{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:50:47.879Z","ordinal":10497,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a5c35ed3c87d08334aec5de8a0037","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The wire evidence changes the design materially:\n\n- Both `subagentStart` events are identical: same parent session, same parent transcript path, same agent name, and even the same timestamp.\n- Only `subagentStop` carries the child UUID.\n- The reported transcript path is the parent `events.jsonl`, not a child file.\n- Stops occur before parent `agentStop`/`sessionEnd`, which is favorable.\n\nSo native start alone cannot correlate concurrent children. I’m examining structural parent-transcript events next to determine whether the task tool exposes a stable call ID→child ID bridge; if it does not, the reviewed design’s fail-closed rule means we must revise rather than guess."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788501045984,"completed_at_ms":1788501047879}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:50:47.881Z","ordinal":10498,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a5c35ed3c87d08334aec5de8a0037","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The wire evidence changes the design materially:\n\n- Both `subagentStart` events are identical: same parent session, same parent transcript path, same agent name, and even the same timestamp.\n- Only `subagentStop` carries the child UUID.\n- The reported transcript path is the parent `events.jsonl`, not a child file.\n- Stops occur before parent `agentStop`/`sessionEnd`, which is favorable.\n\nSo native start alone cannot correlate concurrent children. I’m examining structural parent-transcript events next to determine whether the task tool exposes a stable call ID→child ID bridge; if it does not, the reviewed design’s fail-closed rule means we must revise rather than guess."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","create_time":1788501037.589182,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
