{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:58:32.271Z","ordinal":10642,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a5e06e71887d0a67b5a1e1cb2f8b3","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The third real invocation closed the last uncertainty: built-in `general-purpose` does emit the same native start/stop hooks in Copilot 1.0.82. Its transcript also exposes `agentId` directly on `subagent.started` and `subagent.completed`, so correlation does not require parsing response text at all. That lets me simplify the reviewed plan substantially: no start-time marker, no path-derived IDs, no synthetic child transcript, and no special-case limitation for `general-purpose`."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788501510932,"completed_at_ms":1788501512271}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-04T05:58:32.272Z","ordinal":10643,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016a9a5e06e71887d0a67b5a1e1cb2f8b3","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The third real invocation closed the last uncertainty: built-in `general-purpose` does emit the same native start/stop hooks in Copilot 1.0.82. Its transcript also exposes `agentId` directly on `subagent.started` and `subagent.completed`, so correlation does not require parsing response text at all. That lets me simplify the reviewed plan substantially: no start-time marker, no path-derived IDs, no synthetic child transcript, and no special-case limitation for `general-purpose`."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06aeb-fba1-7c73-b9bd-e6c66f69b450","create_time":1788501508.421642,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
