ubagentStop` adds the child UUID as `agentId`. Before invoking\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/AGENT.md:212:that hook, Copilot has already written `subagent.started` to the parent\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/AGENT.md:230:- `subagentStart` cannot be correlated safely and is retained as an observed pass-through hook\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/hooks_test.go:70:\tassertEntryBash(t, hooksFile.Hooks.SubagentStop, agent.WrapProductionSilentHookCommand(\"entire hooks copilot-cli subagent-stop\"))\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/hooks_test.go:71:\tassertEntryBash(t, hooksFile.Hooks.SubagentStart, agent.WrapProductionSilentHookCommand(\"entire hooks copilot-cli subagent-start\"))\ncmd/entire/cli/agent/copilotcli/hooks_test.go:158:\t\tt.Fatalf(\"config missing subagentStart = %v, want outdated\", got)\n"},"started_at_ms":1788541753828,"completed_at_ms":1788541753828}}
