{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:32:12.490Z","ordinal":12117,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a081dc-6d8d-77f3-bc0a-5b28bab962d1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa03888aaa487d0ab455b21004e0b44","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ll run the real Copilot CLI E2E for `TestSubagentCommitFlow` using the candidate Entire binary. This is the paid test that exercises the implementation as an end user: install hooks, invoke Copilot, delegate to the committed custom agent fixture, create a checkpoint, and validate the task record.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe paid E2E adds a different kind of confidence from the earlier evidence captures: those proved Copilot’s raw hook/transcript contract, while this test proves the complete Entire pipeline consumes that contract correctly.\n\nI’m limiting the paid run to the subagent flow in scope rather than spending tokens on unrelated checkpoint scenarios.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788885128714,"completed_at_ms":1788885132490}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:32:12.491Z","ordinal":12118,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa03888aaa487d0ab455b21004e0b44","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I’ll run the real Copilot CLI E2E for `TestSubagentCommitFlow` using the candidate Entire binary. This is the paid test that exercises the implementation as an end user: install hooks, invoke Copilot, delegate to the committed custom agent fixture, create a checkpoint, and validate the task record.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe paid E2E adds a different kind of confidence from the earlier evidence captures: those proved Copilot’s raw hook/transcript contract, while this test proves the complete Entire pipeline consumes that contract correctly.\n\nI’m limiting the paid run to the subagent flow in scope rather than spending tokens on unrelated checkpoint scenarios.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a081dc-6d8d-77f3-bc0a-5b28bab962d1","create_time":1788885121.671243,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
