{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:35:43.095Z","ordinal":12206,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a06465-c2da-73f2-a18c-e3568bc720c2","turn_id":"01a081dc-6d8d-77f3-bc0a-5b28bab962d1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa0395b3b2087d09fde8db511f865cb","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The 1.0.63 contract difference is now clear:\n\n- `subagentStop` omits `agentId`.\n- Its parent transcript still records `subagent.started`, where `agentId == toolCallId`.\n- Child tool events are correctly scoped by that ID, but this older version does not emit `filePaths`.\n\nA safe compatibility rule exists: when stop lacks an ID, select the single not-yet-completed `subagent.started` entry matching the stop’s agent name; fail closed if zero or multiple match. This supports sequential 1.0.63 children without weakening the newer UUID-based concurrent path. I’ll add that narrow fallback and strengthen the paid E2E to require an actual `tasks/.../task.json`."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788885339307,"completed_at_ms":1788885343095}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T16:35:43.096Z","ordinal":12207,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0cd19a3be99e9a99016aa0395b3b2087d09fde8db511f865cb","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The 1.0.63 contract difference is now clear:\n\n- `subagentStop` omits `agentId`.\n- Its parent transcript still records `subagent.started`, where `agentId == toolCallId`.\n- Child tool events are correctly scoped by that ID, but this older version does not emit `filePaths`.\n\nA safe compatibility rule exists: when stop lacks an ID, select the single not-yet-completed `subagent.started` entry matching the stop’s agent name; fail closed if zero or multiple match. This supports sequential 1.0.63 children without weakening the newer UUID-based concurrent path. I’ll add that narrow fallback and strengthen the paid E2E to require an actual `tasks/.../task.json`."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a081dc-6d8d-77f3-bc0a-5b28bab962d1","create_time":1788885308.65996,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
